From: Ruizhi Zhong <ruizhi.zhong88@gmail.com>
Date: 2026-09-26
Subject: [PATCH] respect linker flags when building native backends
Upstream-Status: Pending

Pass Gentoo's linker flags to both native extension links.

--- a/scripts/build-linux-aimdo.sh
+++ b/scripts/build-linux-aimdo.sh
@@ -94 +94 @@
-gcc -shared -o "$CUDA_OUTPUT_PATH" -fPIC -O2 -g -pthread \
+gcc -shared -o "$CUDA_OUTPUT_PATH" -fPIC -O2 -g -pthread ${LDFLAGS:-} \
@@ -103 +103 @@
-gcc -shared -o "$ROCM_OUTPUT_PATH" -fPIC -O2 -g -pthread \
+gcc -shared -o "$ROCM_OUTPUT_PATH" -fPIC -O2 -g -pthread ${LDFLAGS:-} \
